          ],
          "judgment_calls": [
            "package layout: bin/twine -> twine/{registry,cli,bale}.py plus twine/commands/<family>.py discovered by listing, so sessions 2 and 3 add a module each and never edit a shared file",
            "the --json line is emitted even on an internal error (ok false, an error object) before the traceback goes to stderr, so a consumer never reads an empty stdout",
